      "title_o": "Catechol-O-methyltransferase Val158Met genotype moderates the effect of disorganized attachment on social development in young children",
      "authors_o": "Hygen; Guzey; Belsky; Berg-Nielsen; Wichstrøm",
      "year_o": "2014",
